# path flow name state_id
# twotriangles_ragged_branches.tree made rectangular by hand: module 1's leaves are
# wrapped in a single-child pass-through (1:1) so every leaf sits three levels deep.
# L* is invariant under that insertion and the base map equation is not, which is what
# the padding in InfomapBase::padLeafPathsToUniformDepth exploits -- this fixture is
# the independent reference it is checked against.
1:1:1 0.1 "A" 1
1:1:2 0.1 "B" 2
1:1:3 0.1 "C" 3
2:1:1 0.1 "D" 4
2:1:2 0.1 "E" 5
2:2:1 0.1 "F" 6
